      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0008:0001",
      "blockId": "list:parameters:0008",
      "type": "list_item",
      "source": "`itemIdentifier`: The identifier for the new current item, which is `nil` if there isn’t anything to play.",
      "normalizedSource": "`itemIdentifier`: The identifier for the new current item, which is `nil` if there isn’t anything to play.",
      "sourceHash": "c5b2c0e34ffbab27739aa3f73de2004267f718f8974210d82ad0162592e91378",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Parameters",
      "contextAfter": "`snapshotTimebase`: A time base that communicates the initial playback state of the new item. If you specify `nil`, the coordinator assumes that the player pauses at [`zero`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime/zero). You can retrieve an appropriate time base to pass for this value from AVFoundation playback objects like [`AVSampleBufferRenderSynchronizer`](avsamplebufferrendersynchronizer.md). You can also create one manually using the [`CMTimebaseCreateWithSourceClock(allocator:sourceClock:timebaseOut:)`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTimebaseCreateWithSourceClock(allocator:sourceClock:timebaseOut:)) function.",
      "documentTitle": "transitionToItem(withIdentifier:proposingInitialTimingBasedOn:)",
      "framework": "AVFoundation",
      "meta": {
        "marker": "- "
      },
      "ko": "`itemIdentifier`: 새 현재 항목의 식별자이며, 재생할 항목이 없으면 `nil`입니다. `snapshotTimebase`: 새 항목의 초기 재생 상태를 전달하는 타임베이스입니다. `nil`을 지정하면 코디네이터는 플레이어가 [`zero`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTime/zero)에서 일시 중단 상태라고 가정합니다. AVFoundation 재생 객체(예: [`AVSampleBufferRenderSynchronizer`](avsamplebufferrendersynchronizer.md))에서 이 값으로 전달할 적절한 타임베이스를 가져올 수 있습니다. 또한 [`CMTimebaseCreateWithSourceClock(allocator:sourceClock:timebaseOut:)`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMTimebaseCreateWithSourceClock(allocator:sourceClock:timebaseOut:)) 함수를 사용해 직접 생성할 수도 있습니다.",
